# Repository root.
#
# The deployable application lives in `vokr/` and has its own .gitignore.
# This file governs the reference material kept alongside it.

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/

# Never commit an environment file anywhere in the tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Legacy reference material -------------------------------------------
#
# `vokr-production.zip` (the 27-page static site), the backend scope
# document and the architecture PDF ARE tracked — Phase 4 migrates from
# them and the plan cites them, so a fresh clone must be self-sufficient.
#
# These two are deliberately excluded:
#
#  * "index (7).html" — a 19.9 MB homepage variant with ten inlined base64
#    images. It is the exact artefact R21 exists to eliminate; putting it
#    in git history would permanently bloat every clone for no benefit.
#    The finding it evidences is recorded in the implementation plan.
#
#  * "vokr-production (1).zip" — byte-identical to vokr-production.zip
#    apart from one CSS hex value (.footer-bottom a:hover #000 -> #fff).
#    One canonical copy of the legacy site is enough.
#
index (7).html
vokr-production (1).zip
